### 正常注册
POST http://localhost:8081/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"exp10-user-a","password":"secret123","phone":"13600136000"}

### 用户名长度与手机号格式校验
POST http://localhost:8081/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"x","password":"secret123","phone":"12345"}

### 用户名非空校验
POST http://localhost:8081/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"password":"secret123","phone":"13900139000"}

### 重复手机号 首次注册
POST http://localhost:8081/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"exp10-phone-a","password":"secret123","phone":"13700137000"}

### 重复手机号 再次注册
POST http://localhost:8081/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"exp10-phone-b","password":"secret123","phone":"13700137000"}

### 系统异常统一兜底
GET http://localhost:8081/api/exp10/system-error
